This crate (`symphonia-format-qcp`) is a pure-Rust QCP demuxer. It is licensed under the Mozilla
Public License, v. 2.0, like the rest of Project Symphonia.

The file layout follows RFC 3625 ("The QCP File Format and Media Types for Speech Data"), and the
packetization (the variable-rate rate-map table, the fixed packet size, the handling of truncated
data chunks) and the codec GUIDs follow FFmpeg's `libavformat/qcp.c`, which is distributed under the
GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later.

